# Secrets, per-PC configuration and runtime state.
# 認証情報の実体は %LOCALAPPDATA%\GmailAutoDownloader 配下だが、
# 誤ってアプリフォルダーへ置かれた場合に備えて除外を残す。
credentials.json
service_account.json
token.json
token.json.invalid.*
token.pickle
config.ini
log/
state/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# app_settings.save_settings() writes config.ini via this temp file first.
config.ini.tmp
# Local Claude Code agent config, not part of the distributed app.
.claude/
